      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RACHELS LEGACY (7) will appreciate the step back from Group One level after a fine effort to come from the back row and place in the Victoria Oaks at her latest appearance at Melton. Draws wide but owns good records both here and at the distance. DELIZIOSO (8) found winning form when third-up off a long spell last start, getting home by close 2m at Shepparton. Must overcome a very wide draw but won her lone attempt at this circuit and distance and should be at her peak now. CAPTURE OUR HEART NZ (5) has a strong record here so must be a chance on the back of a good win last week, coming from wider to score at this circuit and distance. HUNGRY BRONNIE NZ (4) is an interesting newcomer to the Brad Hewitt yard from NZ. Last seen winning at Addington last month. Keep safe.",
